Subject: [PATCH 14/22] fixup! Wave 1, taps: a second tap does one thing; the
 menu, its search and the ways back

fixup! Wave 1, taps: a second tap does one thing; the menu, its search and the ways back

- No blank page between two pages: a page not known to be slow keeps the page before on the screen (inert) under the
  new name and the closed menu for the frame that paints them; a slow page still says Working it out at once.
- A save is read out once: words that were part of what was just read are not read again (Assumptions).
- Find a page: debt payoff leads to Pay off debts; language finds Settings.
- The helper's pages open by their address and say the helper is not answering (no Page not found).
- Set up my plan's first screen keeps the bar's back (only its question screens draw their own).
- Top bar: the small-phone rule runs to 389 px and the pill is 116 px wide, so no name is cut at 375 to 389 px.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FKTjPFbzEx2ZvP4BhqKEiS
